        "summary": "Since v1.0.3 this diff adds zip and tar consistency checks against archive smuggling and renames project.json to shadybin.json. It moves the credential-stripping environment filter into internal/env and applies it to go list, go, cargo metadata and zig fetch. It also replaces running `zig build --fetch` with hash-checked `zig fetch` in an empty build directory, and classifies in-repo vendored or replaced Go, Rust and Zig code as vendor code. I checked each change for exfiltration, hidden behaviour or weakened checks and found none: every change narrows what the vendor's code can reach or widens what gets reviewed.",
